msgid "必要な道具"
msgstr "Required tools"

msgid "この教材は CPU だけで進められます。GPU がなくても、C++ の練習、MISO の配列と並列ループ、MPI による領域分割、 1 次元熱伝導の実習、MISO のデモの実行まで行えます。"
msgstr "You can work through this course with a CPU alone. Even without a GPU, you can practice C++, use MISO's arrays and parallel loops, decompose the domain with MPI, do the 1D heat conduction practice, and run MISO's demos."

msgid "道具"
msgstr "Tool"

