msgstr "Reads from `CMakeLists.txt` what to build, which sources to use, and which libraries are needed, and generates the build procedure. MISO requires version 3.18 or later"

msgid "MPI（Open MPI）"
msgstr ""

msgid "複数のプロセスでデータをやり取りするライブラリと、実行コマンド `mpiexec` です"
msgstr "A library for exchanging data among multiple processes, and the run command `mpiexec`"

msgid "yaml-cpp"
msgstr ""

